  "note": "A sample so the chips on the setup screen are not empty on your first run. These are common titles across a broad range of work, not a recommendation, and they are meant to be replaced rather than lived with. Your own list goes in families.json in your vault folder, where it is yours and is never in this repository -- same shape as this file, and \"replaceShipped\": true there drops this sample entirely. A family with the same id as one here replaces it outright.",
